WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:03.750
Joe Biden is going full speed ahead with his
cabinet.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:08.620
Yesterday, we talked about three selections,
secretary of state, national security adviser

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.570
and ambassador to the United Nations.

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:15.250
Today, we have three more actually four more
to tell you about, which I will do momentarily.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:21.689
And as great as it is to see Joe Biden do
this, it is also fascinating to watch the

00:00:21.689 --> 00:00:29.380
car crash of Donald Trump just being so triggered
by Joe Biden moving ahead and selecting his

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:30.380
cabinet.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:34.989
Yesterday, when I told you about three of
Joe Biden selections, I mentioned some tweets

00:00:34.989 --> 00:00:41.430
that Donald Trump sent over the weekend about
how mad he is that Joe Biden is moving ahead.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.730
As Joe Biden continues to make selections.

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:48.090
Donald Trump continues to tweet, despite Donald
Trump having effectively conceded the race

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.770
by telling the GSA to move forward with the
transition.

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:57.570
Donald Trump tweeting in certain swing states
there were more votes than people who voted

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:58.899
and in big numbers.

00:00:58.899 --> 00:01:03.749
Now, since Rudy Giuliani has said, that's
actually a bit of an exaggeration.

00:01:03.749 --> 00:01:06.720
Trump going on to say, does that not really
matter?

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:12.549
Stopping poll watchers, voting for unsuspecting
people, fake ballots and so much more such

00:01:12.549 --> 00:01:15.990
egregious conduct, we will win.

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:21.080
And with every announcement from Joe Biden,
another tweet from Donald Trump claiming he

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.080
will win.

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:26.750
So we now have the privilege, and I really
consider it that.

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:34.590
That after four years of playing defense and
nonsense every day from this administration,

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:42.000
we are starting to get back into meaty and
substantive politics selections of people

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.399
who are actually qualified to be in the positions
for which they are being selected.

00:01:47.399 --> 00:01:53.049
And let's review where we are so far with
Joe Biden's choices, of course, Vice President

00:01:53.049 --> 00:01:59.930
Kamala Harris, that we knew she will be the
first female president or vice president.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:06.210
And a very interesting selection, one that
in some ways progressives are fearful of.

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:08.369
In some ways, progressives are welcoming.

00:02:08.369 --> 00:02:09.980
We know about Kamala Harris.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:15.490
We knew about Donald Joe Biden, Rather's chief
of staff selection, Ronald Klain, who will

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:18.550
be a very boring chief of staff.

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:21.020
He will be scandal free.

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:27.300
And I expect him to last a while in significant
contrast to what we saw in the Trump administration.

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:31.870
Secretary of State Anthony Blinken, we spoke
about yesterday, National Security Adviser

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:36.790
Jake Sullivan, we spoke about yesterday and
ambassador to the United Nations Linda Thomas

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:37.790
Greenfield.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:43.660
We also spoke about that yesterday, interestingly,
after Donald Trump sort of demoted ambassador

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:47.490
to the U.N. and pushed it out of the National
Security Council.

00:02:47.490 --> 00:02:53.120
Joe Biden will be really evading ambassador
to the U.N. to a cabinet level role.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.310
It will be part of the National Security Council.

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:56.520
I think that's important.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:03:00.990
It shows that you are taking seriously the
relationship to the United Nations.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:03.470
OK, we knew all of that yesterday.

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:09.090
New selection from Joe Biden as the cabinet
is filled out, Treasury secretary will be

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:10.230
Janet Yellen.

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:16.130
Now, Janet Yellen was previously the chair
of the Federal Reserve and she will also be

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:20.660
the first ever woman running the Department
of the Treasury.

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:24.950
Now, you know that I am not an identity politics
guy.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:27.220
I want someone who is qualified.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:34.950
And there is no way to argue that Janet Yellen
is unqualified and it is powerful and inspiring

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:39.000
and interesting that she will also be the
first woman in that position.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:45.890
She is going to get a fragile economy in the
midst of coronavirus with high unemployment.

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:51.730
Almost certainly Yellen will be at the center
of a second coronavirus relief bill, which

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:57.380
we have every belief that Joe Biden as president
is going to try to put in place.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:03.370
She will have a massive undertaking that she
will be walking into on day one and likely

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:04.530
even before day one.

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:06.210
And she will be tested right away.

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:14.670
Now, in terms of Yellen for markets, markets
will likely do do well as a result of this

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:17.449
market's early today liking the selection.

00:04:17.449 --> 00:04:19.889
Yellen is a known entity already.

00:04:19.889 --> 00:04:27.419
And, of course, for those who are on the right
and we're worried about, oh, socialism, Biden,

00:04:27.419 --> 00:04:31.840
the socialist, the communist, the selection
of Janet Yellen.

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:33.949
We'll talk about the progressive reaction.

00:04:33.949 --> 00:04:38.580
But the selection of Janet Yellen, if you
are in any way connected to reality, should

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:43.520
confirm that there is no socialism or communism
going on here.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:49.370
Meanwhile, there are lots of progressives
who are OK with Janet Yellen.

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:53.810
She has gone after corporate power in the
past.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:57.530
She went after Wells Fargo during the fiasco
years.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.530
She's not an ideologue.

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:06.439
And at least as far as Joe Biden is likely
to pursue the economic agenda he ran on, Janet

00:05:06.439 --> 00:05:10.240
Yellen is not the type of person who is likely
to get in the way of any of it.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:14.580
It will still be up to Biden to actually pursue
it, to pursue it.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:19.300
Some elements of it will be affected by whether
or not Democrats take the Senate.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:20.521
There are many ifs, ands and butts.

00:05:20.521 --> 00:05:24.539
But Janet Yellen is not someone who will get
in the way of any of what Joe Biden wants

00:05:24.539 --> 00:05:29.320
to do that he ran on, much of which was at
least acceptable to progressives.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:32.740
OK, we'll talk more about Janet Yellen in
the future.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:40.669
Another very interesting selection, secretary
of Homeland Security will be Alejandro America's

00:05:40.669 --> 00:05:43.090
first Latino in this position.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:50.509
Also, a Jewish man who has taken very seriously
the issue of anti-Semitism will be very interesting

00:05:50.509 --> 00:05:55.520
