00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:26.409
How does she clean up this fiasco of lack
of trust in the intelligence can?

00:06:26.409 --> 00:06:31.939
Unity as a result of four years of Donald
Trump slamming them, she has her work cut

00:06:31.939 --> 00:06:34.050
out climate czar.

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:35.999
This is a very interesting position.

00:06:35.999 --> 00:06:39.219
John Kerry will be climate czar.

00:06:39.219 --> 00:06:45.110
Now, merely having a climate and environmental
czar is a move in the right direction.

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:46.870
Kerry is super smart.

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:53.169
One of the people I met earlier on in hosting
the show, this position will be on the National

00:06:53.169 --> 00:06:54.860
Security Council.

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:59.590
That's important, recognizing that climate
is a national security issue.

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:01.159
This is a really great thing.

00:07:01.159 --> 00:07:03.120
Now, one other thought.

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:09.550
There are really interesting identity stories
here, but absent the identity stories, there

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:13.780
